    "title": "South Carolina vs. UCLA box score: Full stats from 2026 NCAA Women's Championship game | Sporting News",
    "text": "The national championship trophy lies in repose at Mortgage Matchup Center in Phoenix, waiting for one of women's college basketball's truest titans to lace their fingers around its surface.No. 1 South Carolina and No. 1 UCLA have enjoyed sparkling campaigns, recording 36 wins apiece. Their stirring exploits have followed them through tournament play, with the Gamecocks scoring a stunning -- and controversial -- win against UConn in the Elite Eight. The Bruins returned the favor in the nightcap, blighting Madison Booker's influence en route to a 51-44 win. The stars will be out come Sunday national championship. Joyce Edwards, Ta'Niya Latson and Madina Okot lead a gifted South Carolina side searching for its third title in five seasons, UCLA, meanwhile, is spearheaded by its senior contingent of Lauren Betts, Gianna Kneepkens, Kiki Rice, Charlisse Leger-Walker and Gabriela Jaquez.Suffice to say, fireworks should erupt when Sunday's matchup unfolds. The Sporting News is tracking the live box score from Sunday's national championship between the Gamecocks and Bruins.LIVE: South Carolina battles UCLA inr 2026 NCAA women's basketball national championship gameSouth Carolina vs. UCLA Women's March Madness box scoreSouth CarolinaStartersPlayerMINPTSFG3PTFTREBASTTOSTLBLKPFJoyce Edwards3083-100-02-21132102Madina Okot1363-90-20-1311103Tessa Johnson30146-120-22-2311001Ta'Niya Latson2541-50-02-2323101Raven Johnson3031-70-41-2302113BenchPlayerMINPTSFG3PTFTREBASTTOSTLBLKPFMaryam Dauda1431-41-20-0200023Agot Makeer23113-61-24-4201102Maddy McDaniel1520-60-22-4020000Alicia Tournebize1500-30-10-0603112Ayla McDowell400-00-00-0000000UCLAStartersPlayerMINPTSFG3PTFTREBASTTOSTLBLKPFLauren Betts31146-100-02-21121020Gianna Kneepkens26155-153-72-2140112Gabriela Jaquez34218-142-43-31051101Charlisse Leger-Walker26104-122-50-0424012Kiki Rice31103-71-13-4652304BenchPlayerMINPTSFG3PTFTREBASTTOSTLBLKPFSierra Betts700-10-00-0400002Angela Dugalic2894-80-11-2501114Amanda Muse600-10-00-01